Create a new State (or Event) node + an edge from owner → state in one
transaction. Use for residence-eras, job-eras, event participations,
etc. that the extractor missed but the operator now wants modeled.

Both rows are written to kg_revision_log under a single revision_log_id
so reverse is a clean two-row delete. Refuses node_type outside
{State, Event} — for new Entity nodes go through the regular ingest path.

Always pass a non-empty `reason`. Pass `dry_run: true` to preview.
